4,1,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I hate walking past the corner in August. It smells terrible. I want to know what living next to these options is actually like.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I’m worried about the money. We have different budgets, and nobody has added up what this corner already costs us every year.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Two of us haven't spoken since the last bin row. I care less about the plan and more about if we can still knock on doors after.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,"Every deal here rests on whoever answers the phone first. I need to know, in hours, what this takes out of us.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,One household has this at their gate for years. I don't want to sign something that quietly leaves it that way.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@May, hours matter, but the smell is daily. If the fix just moves the stink, I’m stuck with it.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, the smell is real, but the bills are too. I need to see the actual numbers before we agree to anything.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Midori, numbers are cold. I need to know if this plan keeps us talking or just keeps us silent.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, silence is expensive. If I’m the one always checking, I burn out. I need a fair share of the work.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@May, fairness is key. But if the work is uneven, the gate-house always suffers. I need to see the balance.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I’ll check the station block's bin house and the supervised mornings. I want to see if it’s actually livable.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,I’ll check the ward subsidy and the block ledger. I need to know the true cost and what help we get.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll check the ward complaint log and the residents' meeting statements. I need to see who is actually angry.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I’ll check the truck arrival time and the ward filing requirements. I need to know the schedule and the paperwork load.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I’ll check the measurements of the five frontages and the station block's meeting minutes. I need to see the physical fairness.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
