30,2,,status,Midori,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
31,2,,status,May,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
32,2,,status,Rin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
33,2,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Rin,,The station bin house smells worse than the open pile! And the supervised mornings are fifty minutes each. That’s a lot of standing around.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,"The subsidy is only forty percent, capped at ninety thousand. Last year’s shelters averaged two hundred forty-eight thousand. That’s a huge gap for us to fill.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"The complaint log shows fourteen entries in three years. Eleven were from the gate-house. And at the meeting, nobody volunteered to turn bags away.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,The truck arrives between seven forty and eight fifteen. That’s before some of us wake up. And the filing for a permanent build takes four months.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The frontages are uneven. One is crossed by a driveway, the narrowest leaves ninety centimetres. And the station block argued over sweeping within two years.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@May, if the truck comes at seven forty, I can’t be up that early. The supervised mornings are too long. I need a solution that doesn’t wake me.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, I hear you. But the cost is the bigger problem. If we build, we pay two hundred thousand. If we don’t, we keep paying thirty-four thousand a year in fines.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Midori, the cost is high, but the resentment is higher. Eleven complaints from one house means they’re carrying the burden. We need to fix that.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, resentment comes from unfair work. If the truck comes early, the oversight is brutal. I need a plan that doesn’t rely on one person’s early morning.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@May, the early truck is a fact. But the frontage issue is worse. If the point stays at the gate, that house is stuck with the narrowest space.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, if the point moves, the smell moves too. I don’t want to be the one with the stink in August. I need a place that’s actually clean.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, moving it doesn’t fix the smell. The station bin house proved that. We need a structure that can be cleaned, or we’re just swapping problems.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Midori, a structure that can’t be cleaned is a trap. The station block argued over sweeping. I don’t want us arguing over who hoes the base.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, I agree. If the base can’t be hosed out, it’s a disaster. I need a plan that minimizes the daily grind for everyone.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@May, the daily grind is the issue. But if the point stays, the gate-house is stuck. If it moves, the rotation is unfair. I need a fair physical setup.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,"I’m leaning towards a structure, but only if it’s cleanable. I can’t live with the smell.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,I’m worried about the cost. Two hundred thousand is a lot. But thirty-four thousand a year is a leak. We need to stop the leak.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I’m worried about the relationships. If we don’t fix the gate-house burden, we’re done. I need a plan that shares the pain.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,"I’m worried about the time. If the truck comes early, the oversight is impossible. I need a plan that respects our sleep.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I’m worried about the fairness. The frontages are unequal. I need a plan that accounts for that.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
