60,3,1,talk,Rin,,Option A is too early. Option B moves the smell. Option C is a structure. I hope C is cleanable.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Midori,,Option C costs two hundred thousand. Option A costs time. Option B costs fairness. I need to see which one is least bad.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option A leaves the gate-house stuck. Option B rotates the pain. Option C builds a wall. I need to know which one keeps us talking.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,Option A is early mornings. Option B is moving. Option C is paperwork. I need to know which one is least exhausting.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option A is unfair. Option B is chaotic. Option C is expensive. I need to know which one is most just.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Midori, if C is cleanable, I’ll pay. But if it’s like the station house, I’m out.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, I can’t promise it’s cleanable. But the subsidy helps. We get forty percent back. That’s ninety thousand.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Midori, ninety thousand is good. But the other hundred and fifty thousand is on us. And the gate-house is still stuck with the location.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, the location is the problem. If C is at the gate, the gate-house is stuck. If it’s elsewhere, it’s not C.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@May, exactly. C is at the existing location. That means the gate-house is stuck. I can’t vote for that.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, if C is at the gate, I’m stuck with the smell. I can’t vote for that either.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, I understand. But if we don’t build, we keep paying fines. And the smell stays. It’s a bad choice.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Midori, it’s a bad choice for the gate-house. But it’s the only one that stops the daily chaos. I’m leaning C, but I’m worried.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, I’m leaning A. It’s less money. But the early truck is a nightmare. I need to know if we can shift the window.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"@May, the window is fixed by the truck. You can’t shift it. A is impossible for the early risers.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Rin,,I’m voting C. I hope it’s cleanable. I can’t live with the smell.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Midori,,I’m voting C. The subsidy helps. And it stops the fines. It’s the best financial choice.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,I’m voting C. It’s the only one that stops the chaos. I hope it fixes the gate-house issue.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,May,,I’m voting A. It’s less money. And I can’t do the early mornings for C.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Asuka,,I’m voting B. It’s the only one that shares the burden. I can’t vote for C because it’s unfair.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
